  "text": "Silver Price in the 1980s\nBetween the first (1980-01-31) and last (1989-12-29) monthly observations available for the 1980s, the LBMA silver price went from $35.28 to $5.22 — a decline of 85% — with a sampled high of $35.52 (Feb 1980) and a sampled low of $5.05 (Jun 1986).\nYears in the 1980s\n1980\n1981\n1982\n1983\n1984\n1985\n1986\n1987\n1988\n1989\nSee today's live silver price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop silver bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
